            ) { Text(if(vm.walkForwardLoading) "RUNNING WALK-FORWARD..." else "RUN WALK-FORWARD TEST") }
            Text("Training candidates: reward/risk 1.5, 2.0, 2.5, 3.0. Each test fold starts with fresh simulation capital; the compounded figure is an aggregate, not one continuous account path.", color=Muted, fontSize=10.sp)
